WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:02.844
Roxy woke up and saw a crowd.

2
00:00:02.845 --> 00:00:05.866
"I'm in Mountain National Park," she thought.

3
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:07.574
"How did I get here?"

4
00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:09.310
Her mom smiled at her.

5
00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:13.054
"Are you having fun, Doodle Bug?"

6
00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:15.205
"Doodle Bug?" Roxy thought.

7
00:00:15.206 --> 00:00:17.816
"My parents haven't called me that since . . ."

8
00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.932
She saw herself in a window.

9
00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:22.084
"I'm a two-year-old!"

10
00:00:22.085 --> 00:00:24.358
Brain Invader appeared.

11
00:00:24.359 --> 00:00:26.861
Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams.

12
00:00:26.862 --> 00:00:28.640
But nothing happened.

13
00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:30.679
"You don't have super powers yet."

14
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.861
Brain Invader's voice was in her head.

15
00:00:32.862 --> 00:00:34.832
"But you will soon."

16
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:37.551
"What do you mean?" Roxy thought.

17
00:00:37.552 --> 00:00:41.955
"This is just your memory," the villain said. "Watch."

18
00:00:41.956 --> 00:00:43.908
A park ranger smiled.

19
00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:47.258
"It's your lucky day, folks. Old Misty is about to—"

20
00:00:47.259 --> 00:00:50.668
Fwoosh! Water shot up from the geyser.

21
00:00:50.669 --> 00:00:52.393
Steam filled the air.

22
00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:54.377
The crowd cheered.

23
00:00:54.378 --> 00:00:59.224
Warm drops fell on Roxy.

24
00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:06.020
"I feel different," Roxy thought. "I feel . . . powerful!"

25
00:01:06.021 --> 00:01:09.487
Suddenly Roxy was getting tucked into bed by her mother.

26
00:01:09.488 --> 00:01:11.992
Her dad was holding a picture book.

27
00:01:11.993 --> 00:01:16.452
"No more stories," he said. "It's time to go to sleep."

28
00:01:16.453 --> 00:01:19.855
"No sleep!" Roxy heard herself say.

29
00:01:19.856 --> 00:01:21.940
She was acting like a two-year-old.

30
00:01:21.941 --> 00:01:25.789
Whiz-hoo! Her eye laser beams fired.

31
00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:29.185
Her dollhouse blew up.

32
00:01:29.186 --> 00:01:33.055
Her parents gasped.

33
00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:35.505
Now Roxy was in a booster seat.

34
00:01:35.506 --> 00:01:36.796
She was bigger.

35
00:01:36.797 --> 00:01:39.994
"I must be older now," she thought.

36
00:01:39.995 --> 00:01:42.267
Her parents were up front.

37
00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:44.505
They were driving along a highway at night.

38
00:01:44.506 --> 00:01:46.377
Rain poured down.

39
00:01:46.378 --> 00:01:49.387
"The road is slippery," her dad said.

40
00:01:49.388 --> 00:01:53.084
"Drive carefully," her mom said.

41
00:01:53.085 --> 00:01:55.514
They drove across a bridge.

42
00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:59.198
Another car drove toward them.

43
00:01:59.199 --> 00:02:01.326
Roxy felt her car slide.

44
00:02:01.327 --> 00:02:03.315
"Uh-oh," her dad said.

45
00:02:03.316 --> 00:02:07.051
"Don't hit that car!" Roxy's mom said.

46
00:02:07.052 --> 00:02:09.273
The other car made a sharp turn.

47
00:02:09.274 --> 00:02:10.917
It started spinning.

48
00:02:10.918 --> 00:02:13.226
Roxy saw it smash through the guardrail.

49
00:02:13.227 --> 00:02:15.494
The car flew off the bridge!

50
00:02:15.495 --> 00:02:19.514
Roxy undid her buckle and flew fast.

51
00:02:19.515 --> 00:02:24.044
"Roxy, be careful!" her mom cried.

52
00:02:24.045 --> 00:02:26.784
The car was about to hit the water.

53
00:02:26.785 --> 00:02:30.893
Roxy grabbed it!

54
00:02:30.894 --> 00:02:34.669
She carried the heavy car back up to the bridge.

55
00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:40.746
She gently put it down.

56
00:02:40.747 --> 00:02:42.848
A man stepped out.

57
00:02:42.849 --> 00:02:44.777
He was shaking.

58
00:02:44.778 --> 00:02:47.458
"Mayor Bloom!" Roxy's dad said.

59
00:02:47.459 --> 00:02:49.499
"Are you okay?"

60
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.600
"I think so." The mayor looked pale.

61
00:02:52.601 --> 00:02:54.440
"Thanks to this young girl."

62
00:02:54.441 --> 00:02:57.460
He looked down at her. "You can fly!"

63
00:02:57.461 --> 00:03:02.340
Roxy's mom nodded. "She's like a rocket!"

64
00:03:02.341 --> 00:03:06.450
Suddenly Brain Invader appeared.

65
00:03:06.451 --> 00:03:08.724
"Now you know, Rocket Girl.

66
00:03:08.725 --> 00:03:12.080
You got your super powers from Old Misty.

67
00:03:12.081 --> 00:03:15.995
So did I. Together, let's take over the world!"

68
00:03:15.996 --> 00:03:20.813
Roxy screamed, "No!"

